#: simulation/engine.py:46
msgid "La configuration de cette partie est invalide."
msgstr "This game configuration is invalid."

#: simulation/engine.py:174
msgid "Le règne est terminé. Son résultat est désormais scellé."
msgstr "The reign is over. Its result is now sealed."

#: simulation/engine.py:176
msgid "Ce Prétendant ne peut plus donner d’ordres."
msgstr "This Pretender can no longer issue orders."

#: simulation/engine.py:182
msgid "Ce chantier n’existe pas."
msgstr "This work does not exist."

#: simulation/engine.py:184
msgid "Cette action appartient aux règles V1."
msgstr "This action belongs to the V1 rules."

#: simulation/engine.py:187
msgid "Cette enceinte ne nécessite aucune réparation."
msgstr "This wall needs no repairs."

#: simulation/engine.py:192
msgid "Le niveau maximal de cet ouvrage est déjà atteint."
msgstr "This work is already at its highest level."

#: simulation/engine.py:194
msgid "Il faut réparer l’enceinte avant de la renforcer."
msgstr "The wall must be repaired before it can be strengthened."

#: simulation/engine.py:201
msgid "Les contributions militaires sont invalides."
msgstr "The military contributions are invalid."

#: simulation/engine.py:212
msgid "Les effectifs doivent être des nombres entiers positifs."
msgstr "Troop counts must be positive whole numbers."

#: simulation/engine.py:238
msgid "Choisissez au moins une cité, une seule fois chacune."
msgstr "Choose at least one city, each only once."

#: simulation/engine.py:242
msgid "Cette cité ne relève pas de votre autorité."
msgstr "This city is not under your authority."

#: simulation/engine.py:244
msgid "Les équipes de cette cité sont déjà engagées."
msgstr "This city’s teams are already committed."

#: simulation/engine.py:249
msgid "Les projets d’armement appartiennent aux règles V1."
msgstr "Armament projects belong to the V1 rules."

#: simulation/engine.py:253
msgid "Votre forge est déjà engagée ou son organisation est achevée."
msgstr "Your forge is already committed or its organisation is complete."

#: simulation/engine.py:269
msgid "Choisissez une cité ennemie de cette partie."
msgstr "Choose an enemy city in this game."

#: simulation/engine.py:273
msgid ""
"Une autre expédition est déjà engagée vers cette cité. Aucun moyen n’a été "
"réservé."
msgstr ""
"Another expedition is already committed to this city. No resources have been"
" reserved."

#: simulation/engine.py:278
msgid "Les villages ne constituent pas une cible de pillage disponible."
msgstr "These villages are not available as a raid target."

#: simulation/engine.py:286
msgid ""
"Cette communauté ne peut rejoindre cette frontière par nos possessions."
msgstr "This community cannot reach that frontier through our lands."

#: simulation/engine.py:291
msgid "Certains de ces hommes sont déjà promis à une autre expédition."
msgstr "Some of these people are already promised to another expedition."

#: simulation/engine.py:297
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cette expédition demande au moins {p0} Fidèles au total."
msgstr "This expedition requires at least {p0} Faithful in total."

#: simulation/engine.py:307
msgid "Cet ordre n’est pas reconnu."
msgstr "This order is not recognised."

#: simulation/engine.py:309
msgid "Cette dépense dépasserait les moyens non engagés."
msgstr "This expense would exceed the uncommitted funds."

#: simulation/engine.py:326
msgid "Cet identifiant de confirmation est déjà utilisé."
msgstr "This confirmation identifier is already in use."

#: simulation/engine.py:336
msgid "En V0, une confirmation est définitive."
msgstr "Under V0, confirmation is final."

#: simulation/engine.py:342
msgid "Cet ordre ne peut plus être annulé."
msgstr "This order can no longer be cancelled."

#: simulation/engine.py:385
#, python-brace-format
msgid "La récolte de {p0}"
msgstr "The harvest of {p0}"

#: simulation/engine.py:387
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Les comptes de {p0} sont arrêtés pour cette année. Le prélèvement a fait "
"entrer {p1} Mesures dans son grenier ; {p2} autres n’ont pu y trouver place."
" J’ai inscrit {p3} nouveaux habitants et {p4} habitants rejoignant les "
"Fidèles. La cité compte à présent {p5} habitants. Depuis le début du règne, "
"{p6} de ses habitants ont perdu la vie."
msgstr ""
"The accounts of {p0} are closed for this year. Tax brought {p1} Measures "
"into its granary; another {p2} found no room. I have recorded {p3} new "
"inhabitants and {p4} people joining the Faithful. The city now has {p5} "
"inhabitants. Since the reign began, {p6} of its inhabitants have lost their "
"lives."

#: simulation/engine.py:409
msgid "Le financement réservé n’est plus disponible."
msgstr "The reserved funding is no longer available."

#: simulation/engine.py:416
msgid "Les contributions ne peuvent plus rejoindre cette frontière."
msgstr "The contributions can no longer reach this frontier."

#: simulation/engine.py:421
msgid "La protection contre le pillage est encore active."
msgstr "Protection against raiding is still active."

#: simulation/engine.py:425
msgid "La cité ou l’état de l’enceinte ne permet plus ces travaux."
msgstr "The city or the condition of its wall no longer permits this work."

#: simulation/engine.py:432
msgid "Ordre invalidé"
msgstr "Order invalidated"

#: simulation/engine.py:433
msgid " Toutes les réservations sont libérées."
msgstr " All reservations have been released."

#: simulation/engine.py:485
msgid "Votre décret entre en vigueur"
msgstr "Your decree takes effect"

#: simulation/engine.py:487
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{p0} J’ai fait prélever {p1} Mesures dans les greniers qui les avaient "
"promises. Les nouvelles vous seront rapportées à leur échéance."
msgstr ""
"{p0} I have had {p1} Measures drawn from the granaries that promised them. "
"News will reach you when it is due."

#: simulation/engine.py:502
msgid "La forge a achevé son œuvre"
msgstr "The forge has finished its work"

#: simulation/engine.py:504
msgid "Les maîtres de la forge ont achevé ce que vous leur aviez confié. "
msgstr "The masters of the forge have completed what you entrusted to them. "

#: simulation/engine.py:507
msgid ""
" : tel est désormais l’état de nos hommes. Leur organisation équipera aussi "
"les populations qui rejoindront votre maison."
msgstr ""
" : this is now how our people are equipped. The same organisation will equip"
" those who later join your house."

#: simulation/engine.py:517
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Travaux achevés à {p0}"
msgstr "Works completed in {p0}"

#: simulation/engine.py:519
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Les équipes de {p0} {p1}. L’ouvrage est désormais en service ; j’en tiendrai"
" compte dans les registres à venir."
msgstr ""
"The teams of {p0} {p1}. The work is now in service; I will account for it in"
" future records."

#: simulation/engine.py:592
msgid "Aucun survivant ne peut décrire les forces adverses."
msgstr "No survivor can describe the opposing forces."

#: simulation/engine.py:594
msgid "Les rares survivants ne livrent que des observations incertaines."
msgstr "The few survivors offer only uncertain observations."

#: simulation/engine.py:596
msgid "Nos survivants n’ont rencontré aucun défenseur."
msgstr "Our survivors encountered no defenders."

#: simulation/engine.py:599
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Nos survivants disent avoir rencontré entre {p0} et {p1} hommes, avec un "
"{p2}. Je rapporte ce qu’ils ont vu à la date de cette lettre ; leur récit ne"
" révèle pas les forces de tout le domaine adverse."
msgstr ""
"Our survivors say they encountered between {p0} and {p1} people, with {p2}. "
"I report what they saw on the date of this letter; their account does not "
"reveal the forces of the entire opposing domain."

#: simulation/engine.py:637
msgid "L’expédition renonce au combat"
msgstr "The expedition abandons battle"

#: simulation/engine.py:639
msgid ""
"Le combat n’a plus lieu d’être. Les hommes rentrent selon le calendrier "
"prévu, sans remboursement."
msgstr ""
"The battle no longer has a purpose. The people will return on schedule, "
"without reimbursement."

#: simulation/engine.py:653
msgid "Pillage impossible"
msgstr "Raid impossible"

#: simulation/engine.py:655
msgid ""
"Les villages sont encore protégés. Les hommes rentrent sans remboursement."
msgstr ""
"The villages are still protected. The people return without reimbursement."

#: simulation/engine.py:678 simulation/engine.py:773
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{p0} à {p1}"
msgstr "{p0} at {p1}"

#: simulation/engine.py:680
#, python-brace-format
msgid "La nouvelle de cette expédition nous est parvenue. {p0} "
msgstr "News of this expedition has reached us. {p0} "

#: simulation/engine.py:685
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Les survivants transportent {p0} Mesures vers leurs origines ; nous ne "
"pourrons les engager avant leur retour. "
msgstr ""
"The survivors carry {p0} Measures towards their origins; we cannot commit "
"them before their return. "

#: simulation/engine.py:689
msgid "Les survivants rentreront sans butin. "
msgstr "The survivors will return without loot. "

#: simulation/engine.py:697
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Les villages de {p0} ont été attaqués"
msgstr "The villages of {p0} have been attacked"

#: simulation/engine.py:699
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Le raid sur nos villages a coûté la vie à {p0} de nos Fidèles. Les "
"assaillants ont emporté {p1} Mesures et en ont détruit {p2} autres. Ces "
"pertes sont inscrites dans le grenier de la cité. "
msgstr ""
"The raid on our villages cost {p0} of our Faithful their lives. The "
"attackers carried away {p1} Measures and destroyed another {p2}. These "
"losses are recorded in the city’s granary. "

#: simulation/engine.py:762
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{p0} change de souverain"
msgstr "{p0} changes ruler"

#: simulation/engine.py:764
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Le nom du souverain a changé dans les registres de {p0}. La cité relève "
"désormais de {p1} ; c’est tout ce que cette nouvelle publique nous apprend."
msgstr ""
"The ruler’s name has changed in the records of {p0}. The city now belongs to"
" {p1}; that is all this public news tells us."

#: simulation/engine.py:775
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{p0} Les survivants repartent vers leurs origines ; ils y rejoindront les "
"présents à la date annoncée. "
msgstr ""
"{p0} The survivors depart towards their origins; they will rejoin those "
"present there on the announced date. "

#: simulation/engine.py:784
#, python-brace-format
msgid "La bataille de {p0}"
msgstr "The battle of {p0}"

#: simulation/engine.py:786
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Voici l’issue que l’on nous rapporte : {p0}. Nous avons perdu {p1} Fidèles "
"engagés, dont {p2} de la garnison locale, ainsi que {p3} civils. "
msgstr ""
"This is the outcome reported to us: {p0}. We have lost {p1} committed "
"Faithful, including {p2} from the local garrison, as well as {p3} civilians."
" "

#: simulation/engine.py:794
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Le siège a consommé {p0} Mesures prises dans le grenier de cette cité. "
msgstr "The siege consumed {p0} Measures from this city’s granary. "

#: simulation/engine.py:822
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Retour à {p0}"
msgstr "Return to {p0}"

#: simulation/engine.py:824
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"J’ai fait inscrire le retour de {p0} Fidèles à {p1}. Ils rejoignent les "
"présents de leur cité d’origine. {p2}"
msgstr ""
"I have recorded the return of {p0} Faithful to {p1}. They rejoin those "
"present in their city of origin. {p2}"

#: simulation/engine.py:835
msgid "Une expédition ne reviendra pas"
msgstr "An expedition will not return"

#: simulation/engine.py:836
msgid "Aucun homme n’a survécu. Aucun butin n’est déposé."
msgstr "No one has survived. No loot is deposited."

#: simulation/engine.py:881
msgid "Votre prétention au trône s’achève"
msgstr "Your claim to the throne ends"

#: simulation/engine.py:883
msgid ""
"Vous ne possédez plus de cité. Vos armées encore en route rentrent vers "
"leurs origines."
msgstr ""
"You no longer own a city. Your armies still on the road return towards their"
" origins."

#: simulation/engine.py:907
msgid "Le règne est achevé"
msgstr "The reign has ended"

#: simulation/engine.py:909
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Au premier rang : {p0}. Les opérations encore en route ne modifieront plus "
"ce résultat."
msgstr ""
"In first place: {p0}. Operations still in transit will no longer change this"
" result."

#: simulation/engine.py:945
msgid "Ce règne est déjà terminé."
msgstr "This reign has already ended."

